## Current State Assessment

### What Works
✅ **Landing Page Builder** - Successfully generates single-page sites
✅ **Agent Spawning** - Agents can spawn sub-agents, communicate via Kafka
✅ **Git Deployment** - Sites can be committed to git repositories
✅ **Basic Orchestration** - Multi-step workflows execute successfully
✅ **Agent Definitions** - Agent types stored in database, configurable

### What's Broken
❌ **Multipage Website Builder** - Race conditions, doesn't complete
