## Critical Success Factors

### Keep Each Phase Independent
- Phase 1 doesn't need Phase 2
- Phase 2 doesn't need Phase 3
- Can stop at any phase and have working system

### Test Thoroughly Before Advancing
- Each phase should be stable
- Regression tests at each phase
- Don't accumulate technical debt

### Measure Quality
- Track content quality scores
- Monitor user satisfaction
- Compare persona vs non-persona output
- Validate component reusability

### Prioritize Learning
- Phase 4 (interrogation) teaches Phase 3 (components)
- Phase 5 (cognitive) applies to all content
- Each phase makes previous phases better

